{"id":"wb-7-328","name":"汉魏许都故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汉魏许都故城","text":"汉魏许都故城又称张潘故城，位于河南省许昌市中心东南18公里处的建安区古城村旁。\n1986年，河南省政府以张潘故城之名列为第二批省级文物保护单位。2013年5月，中国国务院，以汉魏许都故城之名列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位（古遗址）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E9%AD%8F%E8%AE%B8%E9%83%BD%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":93685867,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93685867","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4215d0634b49701fee37e42c.jpg","title":"20240826_Site_of_Xuchang_City_in_the_Eastern_Han_and_Cao_Wei_Dynasty_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240826_Site_of_Xuchang_City_in_the_Eastern_Han_and_Cao_Wei_Dynasty_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/20240826_Site_of_Xuchang_City_in_the_Eastern_Han_and_Cao_Wei_Dynasty_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉魏许昌故城","width":320,"height":213}}